></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Yancopoulos</surname><given-names>George D.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Valenzuela</surname><given-names>David M.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Murphy</surname><given-names>Andrew</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Karow</surname><given-names>Margaret</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Stevens</surname><given-names>Sean</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Pearce</surname><given-names>Edward J.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Artis</surname><given-names>David</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>11</day><month>5</month><year>2009</year></pub-date><volume>206</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>1201</fpage><lpage>1201</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2009 by the Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2009</copyright-year></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p>Vol. 206, No. 4, April 13, 2009. Pages <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="206" page="937" id="d32e136" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="19349464" ext-link-type="pubmed">937&#x02013;952</related-article>.</p><p>A description of the RELM-&#x003b1;&#x02013;deficient mice used in this study also appeared in a paper published in December, 2008 in the <italic>Journal of Allergy and Clinical Immunology</italic> (Munitz et al. <italic>J. Allergy Clin. Immunol</italic>. 2008. 122:1200&#x02013;1207). The Munitz et al. paper was cited in the Discussion (reference 53), but this citation was inadvertently omitted in the Results section.</p></body></article>